# Project Development Guidelines

The project instructions live in `AGENTS.md` at the repository root, which Cursor loads
natively. Read it before changing anything: stack, repo map, commands, binding principles
from `.specify/memory/constitution.md`, and the required checklists for a new backend module
(admin permissions, command palette, migrations, i18n, overlay modules).

Do not copy content from `AGENTS.md` into this rule — a duplicated copy is how these two
files drifted apart before 2026-07-31. Repository-wide rules belong in `AGENTS.md`; only
Cursor-specific configuration belongs in `.cursor/`.

Role-specialised subagents are defined in `.cursor/agents/`:
`endora-commerce-architect`, `endora-commerce-dev`, `endora-commerce-product-owner`.
